  "name": "proximal humerus fracture",
  "description": "Fracture involving the proximal humerus. Describes location (anatomic/surgical neck, tuberosities), displacement (categorical and measured), intra-articular extension, and temporal status (new/unchanged/healing/healed). Useful for radiographic reporting and orthopedic management.",
